          "phonetic": [
            "/ˈkɒfi/",
            "/ɔːr/",
            "/tiː/"
          ],
          "pos": "选择疑问句",
          "meaning": "咖啡还是茶"
        }
      ],
      "explanations": [
        "**prefer A or B?** 是选择题问法。常见错误：\n• \"Do you **more** like coffee\" → 比较要用 prefer，不是 more like\n• \"Do you prefer **to** coffee\" → prefer 直接接名词，不加 to",
        "**prefer** 常见搭配：prefer A to B（比起 B 更喜欢 A）、prefer doing。注意这里 A or B 问句结构。"
      ],
      "distractors": [
